T1  - Estimation of the Mixed Layer Depth in the Indian Ocean from Surface Parameters: A Clustering-Neural Network Method
JF  - SENSORS
PY  - 2022/08/01
VL  - 22
IS  - 15
DO  - DOI 10.3390/s22155600
